                        ],
                        "form": "das Artikelwort"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "755c04a0-0813-4819-90b0-f947baf92dc9",
                        "entry_id": "1313bdf7-97c0-34dd-832b-c37b0fbe3e50",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Artikelwörter"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1db40258-5a2e-3fa8-a9a5-71232830cd22",
                        "entry_id": "1313bdf7-97c0-34dd-832b-c37b0fbe3e50",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein Wort, das so wie ein Artikel verwendet werden kann"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58d524e1-ac8e-4844-9465-66a548599244",
                                "sense_id": "1db40258-5a2e-3fa8-a9a5-71232830cd22",
                                "text": "Manche Pronomen können so wie Artikel verwendet werden und gelten dann als Artikelwörter; so z. B. „dieser“ in „dieser Junge“."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3baca663-4202-4c1d-a3d5-cec0799c540d",
                                "sense_id": "1db40258-5a2e-3fa8-a9a5-71232830cd22",
                                "text": "„Diese Klassen der Pronomen werden deshalb als Artikelwörter verstanden, weil sie – wie die Artikel im engeren Sinne – auch immer vor dem Substantiv stehen (also dieselbe Position im Satz haben wie diese), weil sie niemals mit einem anderen Artikel oder Artikelwort koordinativ verbunden werden können (…)“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7987b8a1-a18f-478a-bf0a-48b3fe083781",
                                "sense_id": "1db40258-5a2e-3fa8-a9a5-71232830cd22",
                                "text": "„Man kann also sagen, daß das s des Genitivs zu schwinden beginnt. Während es bei der Masse der Substantive, vor allem bei Substantiven (ohne Eigennamen) nach dekliniertem Artikelwort und bei Eigennamen ohne Artikel, weiterhin fest ist, wird es bei Eigennamen nach einem Artikel und nach Buchstabenwörtern ziemlich häufig weggelassen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "942677ee-4908-49fc-b55f-07904a6d08f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "1313bdf7-97c0-34dd-832b-c37b0fbe3e50",
                        "source_sense_id": "1db40258-5a2e-3fa8-a9a5-71232830cd22",
                        "source_sense_description": "Linguistik: ein Wort, das so wie ein Artikel verwendet werden kann",
                        "target_lang_word": "determiner",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "determiner",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that determines, or helps to determine, something else.",
                                            "A factor that defines something, or one among several that define it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "974c854a-bc71-4e99-9c84-05b36213291f",
                                                "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: definer"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31f0b0e2-9b2c-435d-a4d3-a9dbfd00fade",
                                                "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                                "text": "In quality management, the determiners of quality sometimes differ across use cases."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9103ef97-90d7-4377-8a59-c4f7433fe465",
                                                "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                                "text": "The \"steel-yards\" and \"measures\" were the only determiners of weight and quantity — as the hour-glass and sun dial were of time — possessed at first (so far as appears) by the passengers of the Pilgrim ship […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that determines, or helps to determine, something else.",
                                            "Someone or something (especially a sentient agent) that determines; a decider of a disposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c506831a-1491-4ca0-bc93-13329e02d75c",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "The software is the determiner if no input is given before the prompt times out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "704fa524-b976-463f-93fb-cc6df5b50552",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: decider, decisor, disposer, definer, arbiter, arbitrator, decisionmaker"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3e85424-9830-4d69-86d3-4e82756b82d0",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "He is the determiner [usually referring to God (in theological contexts) and job roles (in administrative contexts)]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7961e6f-478c-4a08-a6b6-cfb7a04d4205",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "Who is the determiner? [administratively or theologically]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e1ff242-19fc-32e2-a4c7-166b63cb6818",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a class of words functioning in a noun phrase to identify or distinguish a referent without describing or modifying it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f0d98f5-3464-4612-a6f5-155124feb309",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1ff242-19fc-32e2-a4c7-166b63cb6818",
                                                "text": "Definite articles, indefinite articles, and cardinal numbers acting as quantifiers are types of determiners."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07305908-b299-4ce1-a613-6a07d60fb56a",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1ff242-19fc-32e2-a4c7-166b63cb6818",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: determinative (broadly synonymous)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac838aa1-e712-33e2-b379-fa9811a37543",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dependent function in a noun phrase that marks it as definite or indefinite. This function is usually filled by words in the determinative class but may be filled by other elements such as a genitive pronoun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be8b89d7-f50c-4e31-8681-fcccd3abde4f",
                                                "sense_id": "ac838aa1-e712-33e2-b379-fa9811a37543",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: determinative (broadly synonymous)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "675b29b7-5cf1-465a-9c27-7119db39bc99",
                                                "sense_id": "ac838aa1-e712-33e2-b379-fa9811a37543",
                                                "text": "In the sentence \"Many people voted for him,\" the word many is a determiner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9de329d7-6746-459f-a645-9e6f214ce36e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1313bdf7-97c0-34dd-832b-c37b0fbe3e50",
                        "source_sense_id": "1db40258-5a2e-3fa8-a9a5-71232830cd22",
                        "source_sense_description": "Linguistik: ein Wort, das so wie ein Artikel verwendet werden kann",
                        "target_lang_word": "déterminant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "déterminant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72021b38-3e4d-3c9f-a969-0942b8c36c49",
                                        "entry_id": "bd9e6929-3eaa-3b16-be0c-d7b32a988edd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quantité scalaire associée à une famille de vecteurs, à une matrice ou à un opérateur linéaire, dont la nullité indique que l’opérateur n’est pas inversible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03ee00c9-e579-3f8c-8b50-3cafabf1431b",
                                        "entry_id": "bd9e6929-3eaa-3b16-be0c-d7b32a988edd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mot-outil dont la fonction syntaxique est d’actualiser le nom en indiquant le cas échéant, un certain nombre de précisions concernant celui-ci : définitude, spécificité, genre, nombre, etc. Comprend en français l’article le, l’adjectif possessif mon, l’adjectif démonstratif ce, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff626f12-fa30-36b4-a7d9-258341d69443",
                                        "entry_id": "bd9e6929-3eaa-3b16-be0c-d7b32a988edd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gène responsable de la transmission des caractères héréditaires"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d51e6d88-5b93-4801-b3ef-9e22c387fb1a",
                                                "sense_id": "ff626f12-fa30-36b4-a7d9-258341d69443",
                                                "text": "Les déterminants fusionnent après fécondation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
